ass=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> siz ona açıktan açığa ve gizliden gizliye yalvararak şöyle dua edersiniz:- Âsımdan Ebubekir Şu'be rivayetinde havften « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"38\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 38.2 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 16.6 23.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 23.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » okunur. Ya'ni -siz ona şiddetli bir korku içinde ümidlenib yalvarcak şöyle dua ve iltica edersiniz <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"338\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 338.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 41.3 41.3 52.6 59.3 59.3 71.3 78.7 94.6 105.0 105.0 120.7 120.7 131.3 138.0 146.3 146.3 158.3 165.0 181.6 181.6 188.3 188.3 197.3 197.3 215.3 215.3 225.7 225.7 241.6 248.3 255.0 261.7 261.7 274.6 274.6 281.3 297.0 297.0 307.6 307.6 314.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 59.3 94.6 120.7 131.3 158.3 165.0 248.3 281.3 314.3 321.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> kasem olsun ki sen bizi bundan kurtarırsan her halde biz şakirînden olacağız dersiniz.- Âsım, Hamze, Kisaî, Halefi Âşir kıraetlerinden ma'dasında «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 59.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.4 23.2 23.2 30.0 42.7 42.7 49.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 16.4 30.0 49.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » okunur ki gaib sıgasile «kurtarırsa demektir. 64. </p>"}